{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>These are the sons of Leah, and Dinah his daughter.</b> He attributed the males to Leah and the females to Jacob, to teach you: a woman who emits seed first gives birth to a male; a man who emits seed first gives birth to a female." "<b>Thirty and three.</b> In their detail you find only thirty and two — rather, this is Jocheved, who was born between the walls as they entered the city, as it says: ״who bore her to Levi in Egypt״ — her birth was in Egypt, but her conception was not in Egypt."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:41.719763927Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}